     "object": "s_kerabbi_yishmael",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "כרבי ישמעאל שאמר משום אבותיו -- the priests' practice accords with R' Yishmael's ruling, in his forefathers' name, that the fat is permitted",
