     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_kohanim_nahagu_heter",
     "gloss_en": "the fat that is on the abomasum -- the priests practised permission with it"
    }
   ]
  },
  "17": {
   "segId": "Chullin.49a.18",
   "sugya": "chullin_49a_chelev_hakeiva",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_ra_bracha_lakohanim",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אלא רבי עקיבא, ברכה לכהנים מנא ליה? -- if 'and I will bless them' is Israel, where does R' Akiva find a blessing for the priests?",
     "against": "p_ra_hkbh_maskim",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_vaavarcha_mevarachecha",
     "gloss_en": "מואברכה מברכיך -- from Gen 12:3 (= p_ra_bracha_lakohanim_vaavarcha)",
     "answers": "obj_ra_bracha_lakohanim",
     "restores": "p_ra_hkbh_maskim"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ra_bracha_lakohanim_vaavarcha",
     "gloss_en": "[for R' Akiva] the blessing for the priests comes from 'and I will bless those who bless you' (Gen 12:3)"
    }
   ]
  },
  "15": {
   "segId": "Chullin.49a.16",
   "sugya": "chullin_49a_chelev_hakeiva",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ry_hkbh_mevarech_kohanim",
     "gloss_en": "R' Yishmael: 'and I will bless them' -- the priests bless Israel and the Holy One blesses the priests"
    }
   ]
  },
  "16": {
   "segId": "Chullin.49a.17",
   "sugya": "chullin_49a_chelev_hakeiva",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ra_hkbh_maskim",
     "gloss_en": "R' Akiva: the priests bless Israel and the Holy One affirms [the blessing] by their hand"
    }
   ]
  },
  "18": {
   "segId": "Chullin.49a.19",
   "sugya": "chullin_49a_chelev_hakeiva",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_mesayea_kohanim",
     "gloss_en": "how does [R' Yishmael] help the priests? he places the priests' blessing in the place of Israel's blessing"
    }
   ]
  },
  "11": {
   "segId": "Chullin.49a.12",
